    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Ryan are delighted to present 1 Townhouse, Dromina, Co. Cork to the market. This charming three-bedroom, two-bathroom mid-terrace residence offers an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, investors, or those seeking a home in a peaceful village setting. Presented to the market vacant and chain free, the property is ready for immediate occupation, allowing its new owners to move forward without delay.\n\nSituated in the heart of Dromina Village, this well-located home enjoys the convenience of everyday amenities on its doorstep while offering the relaxed lifestyle of a welcoming rural community. The property is ideally positioned within easy reach of nearby towns including Charleville, Kanturk and Mallow, providing excellent access to a wider range of shopping, schools, employment opportunities and transport links.\n\nInternally, the accommodation is bright and well-proportioned, extending across three bedrooms and two bathrooms, offering comfortable living space suitable for families, first-time buyers or those looking to downsize. The practical layout provides excellent scope for a purchaser to personalise and modernise to their own taste, creating a home that perfectly suits their lifestyle.\n\nTo the rear, the property benefits from a low-maintenance enclosed yard, providing a private outdoor space that is easy to care for throughout the year. Whether used for outdoor dining, additional storage or simply enjoying the fresh air, this space enhances the property's overall appeal.\n\nThe property is connected to mains water and mains sewage services, ensuring convenience and ease of maintenance for prospective purchasers.\n\nWith its central village location, vacant possession, and excellent potential, 1 Townhouse, Dromina represents an outstanding opportunity to acquire a home with character and convenience in a popular North Cork location. Early viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate everything this property has to offer.\n\nViewing is strictly by appointment with the sole selling agents, DNG Ryan.\n\nKithcen/dining room 4.2 x 3.7 tiled, fitted units\n\nLiving room 3.8 x 4.1 tiled\n\nToilet 1.6 x 1.7 tiled, electric shower\n\nBedroom 3.1 x 2.8\n\n1st floor:\n\nBedroom 2.9 x 3.6 laminate flooring, built in wardrobe\n\nToilet 1.7 x 1.8 tiled, electric shower\n\nBedroom 3.7 x 4.1\n\nKEY FEATURES:\n3 bed, 2 bath\nmid terrace property\nMains sewage\nMains water\nStorage heating\nVacant and chain free\nRear yard\nLocated in the heart of Dromina\nExpands to C. 90sqm\n\nThese particulars have been prepared by DNG John Ryan and whilst every care has been taken to ensure that these are accurate and correct, we are not responsible for any errors, omissions, inaccuracies, if the property is let, sold or withdrawn from sale or if it is not suitable for your purpose. These particulars are for information only and are given under the strict understanding that they do not form part of any contract. Neither whole nor any part of this document or any reference thereto may be included in any public document, circular or statement nor published without the written consent of DNG John Ryan. PSL: 003615"
      },
